# PaeScape linear integration

- Production work for PaeScape lands on `Paepay/tsps` `prod` and
  `Paepay/PaeScape_Realms` `main` — one growing line each.
- Do not merge or pin browser-client changes via parallel branches such as
  `codex/task31-playable-client`.
- `game-client.lock.json` may only advance to a `prod` descendant of the
  previous pin so earlier client fixes remain.
- Read `.agents/skills/paescape-linear-integration/SKILL.md` before PaeScape
  PRs or lock changes.
